# Progress Log

## Current State

**Version**: 1.6.0 | **Repo**: `Dark-Riders/Ultimate-Image-Tools` | **Deployed**: GitHub Pages (`docs/`)

**Architecture**: 5-tab app (Applier / Creator / BG Remover / Annotator / BG Creator) served by Bun HTTP server on port 19683.
- **Applier** (`app.js`): Bulk watermark overlay with drag & drop, folder uploads, ZIP download.
- **Creator** (`public/creator/`, 10 files): Watermark template builder using `window.Creator` namespace. 40 borders, badges, QR, diagonal text.
- **BG Remover** (`public/remover/`, 10 files): AI background removal + manual tools. Uses bare `var` globals with lazy DOM init. Features: pre-mask (keep/remove brush, magic wand, edge-aware quick select with Sobel), AI → Refine flow, post-mask editor, compose mode, send to Annotator.
- **Annotator** (`public/annotator/`, 6 files): Canvas-based text + image editor. Uses `ant`-prefixed `var` globals. Features: text objects with custom fonts/size/color, image drag/scale, snap guides, global effects (drop shadow 360°, outer glow, text shadow), transparent PNG export, batch ZIP.
- **BG Creator** (`public/bgcreator/`, 5 files): Background generator. Uses `bgc`-prefixed `var` globals. 3 modes (solid+texture, gradient+texture, pattern), 25 color palettes, 5 textures, 10 organic seeded patterns, 360° gradient picker, product image composite.
- **Server** (`src/server.ts`): Bun + Sharp, serves static files and processes watermark API requests.
- **Docs** (`docs/`): Mirror of `public/` with `./` relative paths for GitHub Pages.

**Key shortcuts** (mask/premask mode): `[ ]` brush size, `{ }` tolerance, `Ctrl+Z` undo.

**Critical gotchas**: See `agent-notes.md` § Gotchas — especially global scope collisions (`const` vs `var`, `window.images`), CSS `:not([hidden])` pattern, and top-level addEventListener crash.

> Older entries archived in `progress-archive.log`.

